      <description>&lt;p&gt;← &lt;a href=&#34;https://irpanblog2.netlify.app/post/database/&#34;&gt;Kembali ke Database Utama&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DEMNAS&lt;/strong&gt; adalah Digital Elevation Model Nasional Indonesia resolusi tinggi yang diproduksi oleh
&lt;strong&gt;Badan Informasi Geospasial (BIG)&lt;/strong&gt; menggunakan data radar IFSAR (resolusi 8.3m) dan
TerraSAR-X (resolusi 27m). Data dapat diunduh &lt;strong&gt;gratis&lt;/strong&gt; langsung dari server BIG.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&#34;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(140px,1fr));gap:0.8rem;margin:1.5rem 0 2rem 0;&#34;&gt;
&lt;div style=&#34;background:rgba(33,150,243,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(33,150,243,0.2);border-radius:8px;padding:0.9rem;text-align:center;&#34;&gt;
  &lt;div style=&#34;font-size:1.8rem;&#34;&gt;🗂️&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;div style=&#34;font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:700;color:#64B5F6;&#34;&gt;4.777&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;div style=&#34;font-size:0.72rem;color:#888;&#34;&gt;Total Tile&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&#34;background:rgba(76,175,80,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(76,175,80,0.2);border-radius:8px;padding:0.9rem;text-align:center;&#34;&gt;
  &lt;div style=&#34;font-size:1.8rem;&#34;&gt;📡&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;div style=&#34;font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:700;color:#81C784;&#34;&gt;8.3 m&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;div style=&#34;font-size:0.72rem;color:#888;&#34;&gt;Resolusi IFSAR&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&#34;background:rgba(255,193,7,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,193,7,0.2);border-radius:8px;padding:0.9rem;text-align:center;&#34;&gt;
  &lt;div style=&#34;font-size:1.8rem;&#34;&gt;🛰️&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;div style=&#34;font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:700;color:#FFD54F;&#34;&gt;27 m&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;div style=&#34;font-size:0.72rem;color:#888;&#34;&gt;Resolusi TerraSAR-X&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&#34;background:rgba(156,39,176,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(156,39,176,0.2);border-radius:8px;padding:0.9rem;text-align:center;&#34;&gt;
